# <FAMILY-LIFE-COURSE-RULES-END>
# <DELIVERY-RECEIPT-RULES-BEGIN>
# [2026-08-18] DELIVERY AND RECEIPT. One rule per routed floor item. Each reads
# a recipient-side arrival record and an independent attestation, and derives
# the actuality. What makes these delivery routes rather than fiat is entirely
# what sits upstream of the head: a record of something reaching a person.
#
# THE LOAD-BEARING CONJUNCT IS `~($w = $src)`. A provider's own record cannot
# establish that its delivery arrived. Strip that one conjunct and the family's
# whole purpose is gone while every pin below still looks plausible, which is
# why it has its own counterfactual fixture. Same idiom as Article 4's
# multi-signature rule, kept for the same reason.
#
# THERE IS DELIBERATELY NO `person($p)` CONJUNCT. Serve first: help is not
# conditioned on a record entry, and a person never entered on the roster whose
# arrival is independently witnessed still derives the actuality. Verified: the
# actuality derives while `person` stays false. Adding the conjunct would make
# the roster a precondition of being fed, which is the thing the design refuses.
#
# THE SCOPE CONSTANT CARRIES THE ITEM. `observe` is already this file's
# two-place-and-scope attestation idiom; the witness attests at a named scope
# and the scope is what routes the arrival to one floor item and no other.
#
# WHAT THIS DOES NOT DO. It makes an arrival REPRESENTABLE. It does not make
# one happen, authenticate a witness, prove a writer honest, or establish that
# any floor item ever reached anybody. Those are liveness claims and no rule
# here can carry one. The routes ship DORMANT — the record holds no arrival, so
# none of these heads derives for anyone, and every "derives" sentence written
# before today stays true.
#
# `believe` AND `expresses` GET NO ROUTE, and that is a decision rather than an
# omission. Certifying that a person believes is the compelled personal state
# this design refuses, and the entitlement line for `believe` exists to refuse a
# heresy law rather than to deliver a state. For `expresses` the claim is
# narrower: the liberty is not delivered, while the record of speech already
# arrives for a confined person. The liberty shell carries both freedoms as
# person-held limits, using constants that are deliberately not joined to these
# predicates. Do not wire them together.
all $p: all $item: all $src: all $w: receives($p, $item, $src) & authorized($w, DeliveryWitness, $p) & observe($w, $item, $p, FoodScope) & ~($w = $src) -> eats($p).
all $p: all $item: all $src: all $w: receives($p, $item, $src) & authorized($w, DeliveryWitness, $p) & observe($w, $item, $p, ShelterScope) & ~($w = $src) -> dwell($p).
all $p: all $item: all $src: all $w: receives($p, $item, $src) & authorized($w, DeliveryWitness, $p) & observe($w, $item, $p, CareScope) & ~($w = $src) -> healthy($p).
all $p: all $item: all $src: all $w: receives($p, $item, $src) & authorized($w, DeliveryWitness, $p) & observe($w, $item, $p, SecurityScope) & ~($w = $src) -> secure($p).
all $p: all $item: all $src: all $w: receives($p, $item, $src) & authorized($w, DeliveryWitness, $p) & observe($w, $item, $p, CompanyScope) & ~($w = $src) -> meets($p).
# <DELIVERY-RECEIPT-RULES-END>

# <ECONOMIC-CONSTITUTION-RULES-BEGIN>
# [2026-08-28] Direct legal effects only. Person-held barriers use
# prevents/2; the 28 positive public powers use card-specific current,
# reviewed-result, and exact-holder conclusions. No rule below operates a
# service, authenticates a supplied record, advances time, computes a value,
# or imports a Book 2 model. Legacy work, recognition, home, family, floor,
# placement, and public-status predicates are not read here.
# assertion-wall-recognition-binary: recognition remains the Boolean presence or absence of derived reward/1.
# assertion-wall-recognition-arity-one: recognition remains reward/1; no second argument carries status or value.
# assertion-wall-recognition-non-ranked: reward/1 emits no tier, degree, score, or comparison.
# assertion-wall-recognition-unread: no rule consumes reward/1; it remains a terminal derived leaf.
# assertion-wall-book2-model-not-derived: no complete/3 head imports a Book 2 model as a constitutional fact.
# assertion-wall-book2-statistic-not-derived: no complete/3 head imports a Book 2 statistic as a constitutional fact.
#
# Each power has its own PowerScope and current-result constant. The named
# temporal contracts keep licences, knowledge exclusivity, public-scale
# findings, monetary office, temporary management, scarcity, and legal carry
# separate; none borrows the custody T3 record. Missing or fused positive
# premises withhold only the bounded authority. Independent continuity and
# remedy duties remain governed by their own already formalized families.

# Conflicting source attestations fail closed instead of selecting a
# convenient version, case, actor, jurisdiction, scope, end, or card field.
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicSourceAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicRecordReviewAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicEvidenceAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicIndependentReviewAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicAuditAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicFinalReviewAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicExecutionAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $temporal_record: authorized($actor, EconomicTemporalAuthority, $temporal_record) -> related($actor, $temporal_record, EconomicTemporalAttester).
all $actor: all $temporal_record: authorized($actor, EconomicTemporalReviewAuthority, $temporal_record) -> related($actor, $temporal_record, EconomicTemporalAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicReviewerUnavailabilityAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicReviewerUnavailabilityAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, EconomicReviewerUnavailabilityEvidenceAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicReviewerUnavailabilityAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, IndependentEconomicReviewerUnavailabilityReviewAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicReviewerUnavailabilityAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, ObligationsSourceAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicDutySelectionRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, ObligationsEvidenceAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicDutySelectionRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: authorized($actor, IndependentObligationsReviewAuthority, $record) -> related($actor, $record, EconomicDutySelectionRecordAttester).
all $actor: all $record: all $result: related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester) & observe($actor, $record, $result, ResultScope) -> related($actor, $result, EconomicResultAttester).
all $actor: all $record: all $reconciliation: related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester) & observe($actor, $record, $reconciliation, ReconciliationRecordScope) & observe($actor, $reconciliation, $record, EconomicRecordScope) -> related($actor, $reconciliation, EconomicCurrentReconciliationAttester).
all $actor: all $record: all $result: all $reconciliation: related($actor, $record, EconomicRecordAttester) & observe($actor, $record, $result, ResultScope) & observe($actor, $result, $reconciliation, ReconciliationRecordScope) & observe($actor, $reconciliation, $result, ResultScope) & observe($actor, $reconciliation, $record, EconomicRecordScope) -> related($actor, $reconciliation, EconomicResultReconciliationAttester).
all $first_source: all $subject: all $second_source: all $first: all $second: related($first_source, $subject, EconomicRecordAttester) & related($second_source, $subject, EconomicRecordAttester) & observe($first_source, $subject, $first, SourceFamilyScope) & observe($second_source, $subject, $second, SourceFamilyScope) & ~($first = $second) -> contradict($subject, EconomicSourceFamilyBinding).
